# Mosquitto ACL File
# Controls which topics users can subscribe to and publish on

# Allow read/write to all topics for homeassistant user
user homeassistant
topic readwrite #

# Allow read/write for esphome
user esphome
topic readwrite esphome/#
topic readwrite homeassistant/#
topic readwrite zigbee2mqtt/#

# Allow read for zigbee2mqtt  
user zigbee2mqtt
topic readwrite zigbee2mqtt/#
topic readwrite homeassistant/#
topic readwrite esphome/#

# Allow node-red
user nodered
topic readwrite node-red/#
topic readwrite homeassistant/#
topic readwrite zigbee2mqtt/#

# Pattern ACLs for dynamic permissions
pattern readwrite homeassistant/%c/#
pattern readwrite zigbee2mqtt/%c/#
pattern readwrite esphome/%c/#